desc(
	mode: "struct"
	language: "java"
	title: "Struct scan: Java XPath.evaluate"
	title_zh: "结构扫描：Java XPath.evaluate"
	type: vuln
	level: high
	rule_id: "struct-java-xpath-evaluate"
	risk: "xpath-injection"
	desc: <<<DESC
### 规则说明
检测到 XPath.evaluate。表达式拼接用户输入可导致注入。

### 风险类型
xpath-injection

### 影响
该用法属于已知危险 API 或弱密码学配置，可能被用于绕过校验、执行代码或泄露机密。

### 检测方式
结构扫描在编译单元内匹配真实调用，而不是注释或字符串字面量。
DESC
	solution: <<<SOLUTION
### 修复建议
不要拼接 XPath，使用变量或白名单。
SOLUTION
	alert_min: 1
	"file://X.java": <<<POS
import javax.xml.xpath.XPath;
class X { void bad(XPath xp, String e) throws Exception { xp.evaluate(e, new Object()); } }

POS
	"safefile://S.java": <<<NEG
class S { void ok() { System.out.println("static-xpath"); } }

NEG
)

XPath.evaluate as $call
evaluate(* as $e) as $call
alert $call for {
	level: "high",
	title: "Struct scan: Java XPath.evaluate",
	title_zh: "结构扫描：Java XPath.evaluate",
	message: "结构扫描：Java XPath.evaluate",
	risk: "xpath-injection",
}
